  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Card Casting (Cooldown), Charged Spells</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> When you shuffle your discard pile back into your when there are no cards left in your deck, you may recharge any number of charged sphere effects you have cast within the last minute. For each spell you recharge, you must spend a number of spell points equal to the number of spell points spent on the charged sphere effect you recharge (you do not need to use cards to spend spell points as part of using this feat). Whenever you recover one or more maneuvers in this way, your next attack before the end of your next turn deals 1d6 additional damage, plus an additional d6 for every 5 caster levels you possess.</p>\n<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Expanded Spheres: Weaves of War</sup></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/card-and-deck-feats#toc20\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
